# Accept a WeChat Pay payment

Use the Payment Intents and Payment Methods APIs to accept WeChat Pay, a digital wallet popular with customers from China.

## Index

This article has multiple variants. Fetch one of the following URLs to view specific content for your use case:

- [Checkout](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/wechat-pay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=checkout)
- [Direct API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/wechat-pay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=direct-api)
- [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/wechat-pay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=ios)
- [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/wechat-pay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=android)
